    "readingCoachEn": "💡 Level B1 Reading Coach (Avis de perturbation des transports): Scan the text for key clues (\"TRAFFIC INFO — MUNICIPAL TRAMWAY NETWORK.\\n\\nDue to rail renovation an...\") and match them directly to Option B (\"Trams will run with 15-minute extended intervals\").",
