    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option B (\"Trams will run with 15-minute extended intervals\")\n\n• Textual Evidence: The passage (\"TRAFFIC INFO — MUNICIPAL TRAMWAY NETWORK.\\n\\nDue to rail renovation and electrical maintenance on Line 3 between Central Station and University, tram frequencies will experience a 15-minute interval extension all weekend.\\n\\nDynamic displays will inform passengers in real time on platforms. The transit authority advises commuters to allow extra travel time during maintenance.\") directly answers the prompt \"How will tramway operations be altered over the weekend?\".\n• Distractor Analysis: The remaining options distort factual details or introduce unstated assumptions."
