    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option C (\"Monthly bonus and access to a dedicated transit lane\")\n\n• Textual Evidence: The passage (\"TRANSIT AND MOBILITY — SUSTAINABLE COMMUTING BULLETIN: PERI-URBAN CARPOOLING FOR WORKERS.\\n\\nTo curb metro entry traffic jams and lower household fuel spending, the regional authority opened ten carpool parking lots along major highways. A dedicated mobile app matches drivers and passengers sharing daily commuting routes.\\n\\nEncouraging participation, drivers carrying at least two passengers receive a monthly municipal cash bonus and access to a dedicated rush-hour lane.\") directly answers the prompt \"Financial and transit incentive created for carpooling drivers:\".\n• Distractor Analysis: The remaining options distort factual details or introduce unstated assumptions."
