    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option D (\"Preserving senior independence inside reassuring social settings\")\n\n• Textual Evidence: The passage (\"SENIORS AND SOCIETY — AUTONOMY REVIEW: SHARED INTERGENERATIONAL HOUSING FOR AGING ADULTS.\\n\\nOffering alternatives to nursing homes, rural towns are building modern senior housing clusters: small single-story homes centered around common halls and gardens. These setups allow independent seniors to maintain autonomy in a reassuring setting.\\n\\nShared activities with village schools and local non-profits foster rich social lives, preventing isolation.\") directly answers the prompt \"Goal pursued by building modern shared housing clusters for seniors:\".\n• Distractor Analysis: The remaining options distort factual details or introduce unstated assumptions."
