    "readingCoachEn": "💡 Level B1 Reading Coach (Article sur l'énergie citoyenne): Scan the text for key clues (\"ENERGY TRANSITION — CO-OP SOLAR BULLETIN: EXPANDING VILLAGE COMMUNITY ...\") and match them directly to Option D (\"Pooling citizen savings to install local solar arrays on community roofs\").",
