    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option D (\"Pooling citizen savings to install local solar arrays on community roofs\")\n\n• Textual Evidence: The passage (\"ENERGY TRANSITION — CO-OP SOLAR BULLETIN: EXPANDING VILLAGE COMMUNITY SOLAR PLANTS.\\n\\nCitizens form local co-ops to fund and install solar panels on public building roofs and barn tops. The clean electricity generated feeds the local grid or powers collective self-consumption for village residents.\\n\\nThis community energy ownership retains financial returns locally while accelerating regional green energy transitions.\") directly answers the prompt \"Principle behind cooperative village community solar power initiatives:\".\n• Distractor Analysis: The remaining options distort factual details or introduce unstated assumptions."
