    "readingCoachEn": "💡 Level B2 Reading Coach (Analyse sur la gouvernance alimentaire): Scan the text for key clues (\"FOOD GOVERNANCE — LOCAL SOVEREIGNTY PAPERS: TERRITORIAL FOOD PROJECTS ...\") and match them directly to Option A (\"Boosting organic and local produce shares in public catering\").",
