    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option A (\"Boosting organic and local produce shares in public catering\")\n\n• Textual Evidence: The passage (\"FOOD GOVERNANCE — LOCAL SOVEREIGNTY PAPERS: TERRITORIAL FOOD PROJECTS (PAT).\\n\\nTerritorial Food Projects bring together farmers, school cafeterias, local processors, and elected officials to restructure food supply chains locally. The goal is to dramatically increase organic and local produce shares in public catering (schools, hospitals, senior homes) while securing stable markets for regional farmers.\\n\\nRelocalizing food reduces vulnerability to global logistics spikes and improves diner health while strengthening regional food sovereignty.\") directly answers the prompt \"Central objective of local Territorial Food Projects across communities:\".\n• Distractor Analysis: The remaining options distort factual details or introduce unstated assumptions."
